WEBVTT

00:00:05.264 --> 00:00:07.374
I want to love you more

00:00:07.374 --> 00:00:09.674
I want to give you more love

00:00:09.674 --> 00:00:15.414
I just want to hear your voice

00:00:15.414 --> 00:00:29.094
MAGIKANO

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:35.134
As I soaked my fruit corn flakes in milk

00:00:35.134 --> 00:00:39.834
I thought about it with bedhair

00:00:41.234 --> 00:00:45.774
In front of the railroad crossing

00:00:45.774 --> 00:00:51.144
You suddenly covered your ears and stopped

00:00:52.144 --> 00:00:54.814
But listen! I want you more

00:00:54.814 --> 00:00:56.354
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:00:56.354 --> 00:00:59.384
I want to give you more kisses

00:00:59.384 --> 00:01:03.394
I get a little lonely for some reason

00:01:03.394 --> 00:01:05.294
To tell you the truth

00:01:05.294 --> 00:01:06.964
I want to give you more love

00:01:06.964 --> 00:01:08.464
I want to bring you closer to my heart

00:01:08.464 --> 00:01:13.364
So keep your spirits higher

00:01:14.504 --> 00:01:20.514
Your smile is enough to give me a fever

00:01:20.514 --> 00:01:25.774
The fever of happiness is rising

00:01:35.024 --> 00:01:37.064
Welcome home, Master!

00:01:37.064 --> 00:01:37.424
COMIC MAID IN Goldfish
STORY CAFÉ Scooping
TELLING
Welcome home, Master!

00:01:37.424 --> 00:01:38.454
COMIC MAID IN Goldfish
STORY CAFÉ Scooping
TELLING

00:01:38.864 --> 00:01:40.834
Pull! Pull!

00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:42.534
Pull it with all you've got!

00:01:42.534 --> 00:01:43.364
SAKURAMORI ACADEMY
CULTURAL FESTIVAL
Pull it with all you've got!

00:01:43.364 --> 00:01:46.494
SAKURAMORI ACADEMY
CULTURAL FESTIVAL

00:01:48.504 --> 00:01:51.494
CLASS 3-B
American
Maid Café

00:01:54.174 --> 00:01:57.084
Oh, yeah! May I help you?

00:01:57.084 --> 00:01:58.474
Welcome!

00:02:02.684 --> 00:02:04.244
Don't tell me you guys are...

00:02:04.684 --> 00:02:07.054
Ayumi Mamiya! This is an order
from the student council.

00:02:07.054 --> 00:02:10.164
You must report to the dressing room for
student council's theatrical play,

00:02:10.164 --> 00:02:11.524
which is located at the wing of the stage!

00:02:11.524 --> 00:02:15.164
No way! I am NOT going to be in that stupid play!

00:02:15.164 --> 00:02:18.764
Then you leave us with no choice
but to take you there by force!

00:02:21.404 --> 00:02:23.644
May I help me?

00:02:23.644 --> 00:02:28.634
Episode 9
Magi? He's a Sleeping Prince?

00:02:33.144 --> 00:02:34.854
What did you do that for?!

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.544
It's all your fault!

00:02:37.524 --> 00:02:40.254
You have some nerve not even showing up
on the day of the play

00:02:40.254 --> 00:02:42.024
after you insisted on
being a part of the cast!

00:02:42.024 --> 00:02:45.114
I would've gladly showed up if you
had given me a better role!

00:02:46.064 --> 00:02:50.124
Oh! Miss Yuri, I can't tell you how
adorable you look as Cinderella!

00:02:50.964 --> 00:02:52.134
Really?

00:02:52.134 --> 00:02:55.934
But my chest feels too tight and my
waist area feels too loose in this outfit.

00:02:56.604 --> 00:03:00.144
Don't you think you're a little tall for Cinderella?

00:03:00.144 --> 00:03:01.714
Hmph! Get off my case!

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:05.784
No, I won't! First of all, why are you Cinderella?

00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:08.684
Hmph, you still don't get it, do you?

00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:09.554
Huh?

00:03:09.554 --> 00:03:11.884
You saw the note on the
dressing room door, didn't you?

00:03:11.884 --> 00:03:12.154
STUDENT COUNCIL
THEATER COMMITTEE
"CINDERELLA"
DRESSING ROOM
You saw the note on the
dressing room door, didn't you?

00:03:12.154 --> 00:03:14.894
STUDENT COUNCIL
THEATER COMMITTEE
"CINDERELLA"
DRESSING ROOM
This play is being presented by the student council.

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:14.994
This play is being presented by the student council.

00:03:14.994 --> 00:03:16.594
I don't mean to be the center of the attention,

00:03:16.594 --> 00:03:20.194
but it's only natural that they chose me
to play the main character.

00:03:20.194 --> 00:03:22.994
What do you mean "it's only natural"?!

00:03:22.994 --> 00:03:26.054
I know you picked my big brother for the
role of the prince on purpose, too!

00:03:26.204 --> 00:03:27.934
Oh, hey, I didn't know you guys were here.

00:03:27.934 --> 00:03:29.424
What, you got a problem with that?

00:03:30.404 --> 00:03:31.874
I-I certainly didn't pick him on purpose!

00:03:31.874 --> 00:03:34.604
That was the collective decision
of the student council members!

00:03:34.914 --> 00:03:36.444
Oh, Cinderella!

00:03:36.444 --> 00:03:38.714
Wherefore art thou Cinderella?

00:03:38.714 --> 00:03:40.584
Don't think; feel it!

00:03:40.584 --> 00:03:43.214
Yes... You're so manly, Yoshikawa.

00:03:43.214 --> 00:03:44.754
And besides,

00:03:44.754 --> 00:03:49.024
I don't get a chance to wear a cute dress like this
without hesitation very often!

00:03:49.494 --> 00:03:55.264
Oh, I'm so glad I exercised my authority as student
council president and assigned everyone's parts!

00:03:55.264 --> 00:03:56.264
Guys!

00:03:56.264 --> 00:03:59.894
Twenty minutes till the play starts!
Are you all ready to go?

00:04:00.274 --> 00:04:03.004
All right! Have them get dressed as well!

00:04:03.704 --> 00:04:07.574
Why are we the mean sisters
and the evil stepmother?

00:04:07.574 --> 00:04:10.304
That's nothing compared to MY role!

00:04:11.284 --> 00:04:13.014
Why the hell am I the witch?!

00:04:13.014 --> 00:04:14.684
But I think it fits you perfectly.

00:04:14.684 --> 00:04:15.854
Yup, yup.

00:04:15.854 --> 00:04:17.254
How dare you, you backstabbers!

00:04:17.254 --> 00:04:20.554
Anyway, normally, students who aren't
members of the student council

00:04:20.554 --> 00:04:23.294
wouldn't get to take a part in
a play hosted by the student council!

00:04:23.294 --> 00:04:25.994
So you should be thankful that
I even let you be a part of it at all!

00:04:25.994 --> 00:04:28.964
Why do you have to be so snotty whenever
the student council's involved, anyway?

00:04:29.494 --> 00:04:32.224
Hey, for some reason this fake nose
looks almost too realistic...

00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:35.034
I thought you'd never mention it! That's right!

00:04:35.034 --> 00:04:37.044
We, the Supernatural Science Club,

00:04:37.044 --> 00:04:42.744
