So she came, huh?

00:05:55.184 --> 00:05:57.244
Ten minutes till the show!

00:05:58.384 --> 00:06:00.784
Okay, everyone, please stand by!

00:06:01.894 --> 00:06:05.994
Say, Kurosu, I'm sorry that Maika and Mamiya
were being selfish.

00:06:05.994 --> 00:06:09.294
And because of that, casting has gotten all weird,
like me getting the prince role, you know.

00:06:09.294 --> 00:06:11.634
What? It's not like that at all.

00:06:11.634 --> 00:06:14.074
You're already manly enough, Yoshikawa.

00:06:14.074 --> 00:06:15.434
Thanks.

00:06:15.434 --> 00:06:16.534
Kurosu, you're...

00:06:16.534 --> 00:06:17.804
What?

00:06:17.804 --> 00:06:19.534
You're really cool, too!

00:06:21.714 --> 00:06:23.704
Cool, huh?

00:06:27.754 --> 00:06:30.724
Look at those two, being all flirty with each other!

00:06:30.724 --> 00:06:32.384
This totally sucks!

00:06:32.924 --> 00:06:38.724
Why am I upset? He's supposed to be
just a tool to lift my curse.

00:06:39.264 --> 00:06:40.534
Listen very carefully!

00:06:40.534 --> 00:06:44.724
We must do WHATEVER IT TAKES to stop Yuri
from messing with our brother during the play!

00:06:45.104 --> 00:06:47.704
You don't have to get so worked up
about this, you know...

00:06:47.704 --> 00:06:51.804
Nonsense! She could take advantage of this play
and give him a lunchbox she made for him!

00:06:51.804 --> 00:06:54.974
Don't worry. There's no such scene in Cinderella.

00:07:00.714 --> 00:07:02.914
Once upon a time,

00:07:02.914 --> 00:07:06.084
there was an unfortunate girl named Cinderella,

00:07:06.084 --> 00:07:10.184
who was being mistreated by her
stepsisters and her stepmother.

00:07:10.824 --> 00:07:15.324
There is going to be a dance party at the
castle tonight to celebrate the prince's birthday.

00:07:15.394 --> 00:07:18.934
But, Cinderella, you're going to
stay home and clean the house!

00:07:18.934 --> 00:07:20.674
Yup, that's right!

00:07:20.674 --> 00:07:21.504
Meow!

00:07:21.674 --> 00:07:23.304
Poor Cinderella...

00:07:23.304 --> 00:07:26.204
But one day a witch appeared before Cinderella.

00:07:26.204 --> 00:07:28.844
Oh, you poor Cinderella!

00:07:28.844 --> 00:07:31.144
Wear this and go to the party!

00:07:37.984 --> 00:07:41.824
Oh, Miss Yuri! You're so beautiful!

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:44.364
The hell with that! That's nothing!

00:07:44.364 --> 00:07:46.294
Tell me what you think about THIS!

00:07:56.034 --> 00:07:57.974
That was a piece of cake!

00:07:58.274 --> 00:08:02.504
I-I can't believe she used magic at a place like this!

00:08:02.814 --> 00:08:05.344
How did she do that exactly...

00:08:05.344 --> 00:08:07.474
We've got a carriage right here, Bro...

00:08:07.554 --> 00:08:10.244
Huh? What? What's that carriage?!

00:08:11.024 --> 00:08:15.394
Boy, both the president and Ayumi are pretty skilled
when it comes to fooling people, aren't they?

00:08:15.394 --> 00:08:19.494
E-Exactly! I knew they were up to something, but...

00:08:19.494 --> 00:08:22.434
Who would've thought that they were
working on a trick like that, huh?

00:08:22.434 --> 00:08:24.234
I get it!

00:08:24.234 --> 00:08:25.434
I see!

00:08:25.434 --> 00:08:29.074
To think that they also thought about
entertaining US! How considerate!

00:08:29.074 --> 00:08:30.834
That's my Miss Yuri!

00:08:32.704 --> 00:08:35.044
Jeez, give me a break, Ayumi!

00:08:35.044 --> 00:08:36.414
Thanks to Miss Yuri's surprise...

00:08:36.414 --> 00:08:39.314
No, I meant, thanks to the old witch,

00:08:39.314 --> 00:08:43.944
Cinderella managed to go to the party at the castle!

00:08:47.324 --> 00:08:51.054
Ladies and gentlemen! I hope
that you all enjoy tonight's party!

00:08:51.424 --> 00:08:54.434
Big Brother looks so hot in that costume!

00:08:54.434 --> 00:08:56.664
Jeez, that's the same stuff he was wearing earlier...

00:08:56.764 --> 00:08:59.204
What a fateful meeting!

00:08:59.204 --> 00:09:04.234
The very moment Cinderella and the prince met,
they fell in love with each other at first sight.

00:09:05.004 --> 00:09:06.674
I know I'm just doing my job,

00:09:06.674 --> 00:09:10.114
but I can't believe I have to read stuff like this.

00:09:10.114 --> 00:09:13.174
Oh, I wish I could switch with the prince...

00:09:13.344 --> 00:09:15.114
That damn Yuri!

00:09:15.114 --> 00:09:17.484
Now that it's come down to this,
I'm going to ruin the play completely!

00:09:20.754 --> 00:09:22.914
Huh? I haven't done anything yet!

00:09:24.064 --> 00:09:25.164
What's going on?

00:09:25.164 --> 00:09:26.564
What? What just happened?

00:09:26.564 --> 00:09:27.994
Big Brother!

00:09:28.164 --> 00:09:30.154
What's that?

00:09:33.104 --> 00:09:36.664
Who's the fairest of them all?

00:09:38.874 --> 00:09:39.934
Michiru?!

00:09:48.184 --> 00:09:49.014
Yoshikawa!

00:09:49.014 --> 00:09:50.114
Big Brother!

00:09:52.484 --> 00:09:53.854
Senior!

00:09:57.194 --> 00:09:58.214
Haruo!

00:09:59.924 --> 00:10:00.694
Big Bro!

00:10:00.694 --> 00:10:02.024
Big Brother Haruo!

00:10:05.464 --> 00:10:06.764
Huh?

00:10:10.604 --> 00:10:12.044
Big Bro! Big Sis!

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:13.094
That was...
Big Bro! Big Sis!

00:10:17.644 --> 00:10:19.634
Miss Hongo?!

00:10:36.064 --> 00:10:36.894
What is this place?

00:10:36.894 --> 00:10:39.954
For some reason it feels like I've been here before...

00:10:40.904 --> 00:10:44.434
This is Lady Michiru's dark domain.
Please be careful.

00:10:44.904 --> 00:10:46.274
Who is Michiru?

00:10:46.274 --> 00:10:49.814
Sh-She's my younger sister.

00:10:49.814 --> 00:10:50.914
Your younger sister?

00:10:50.914 --> 00:10:52.144
Oh, I see!

00:10:52.144 --> 00:10:54.784
That explains why the atmosphere in this world
is so similar to yours!

00:10:54.784 --> 00:10:58.344
Wait, Ayumi! Didn't you say
you're an only daughter?

00:10:58.454 --> 00:11:02.394
So this means the evil witch's younger sister
is also an evil witch, doesn't it?

00:11:03.724 --> 00:11:07.164
What in the world is Michiru doing
in the human world anyway?

00:11:09.864 --> 00:11:11.024
She's up there!

00:11:13.034 --> 00:11:15.404
I knew you'd come, Big Sister!

00:11:15.404 --> 00:11:18.074
But I didn't think you'd bring your friends with you.

00:11:18.074 --> 00:11:20.714
These people are NOT my friends!

00:11:20.714 --> 00:11:22.614
What are you planning to do with my big brother?

00:11:22.614 --> 00:11:24.284
I'm sorry to tell you this,

00:11:24.284 --> 00:11:26.814
but this man will remain asleep forever!

00:11:26.814 --> 00:11:28.384
Forever?!

00:11:28.384 --> 00:11:30.874
Wait! Where are you taking him?

00:11:32.884 --> 00:11:36.884
Isn't it obvious? There's only one place
where a person sleeps forever!

00:11:47.534 --> 00:11:50.074
So he's a sleeping prince, huh?

00:11:50.074 --> 00:11:51.874
The castle sure looks familiar, too...

00:11:51.874 --> 00:11:54.034
They are sisters, after all.

00:11:55.514 --> 00:11:56.874
Oh, don't go there!

00:11:56.874 --> 00:11:59.444
Unlike me, Michiru is the worst kind of girl.

00:11:59.444 --> 00:12:03.004
She's selfish, self-centered and never admits
her own wrongdoings!

00:12:03.154 --> 00:12:03.984
Huh?

00:12:03.984 --> 00:12:05.924
Sounds just like you then.

00:12:05.924 --> 00:12:07.284
Yup, yup.

00:12:09.194 --> 00:12:10.314
Please be quiet.

00:12:10.864 --> 00:12:12.724
Something is coming.

00:12:20.034 --> 00:12:21.934
The giant from Jack and the Beanstalk?!

00:12:25.274 --> 00:12:26.844
Please leave him to me.

00:12:26.844 --> 00:12:27.934
We're counting on you!

00:12:30.374 --> 00:12:32.314
Hang in there, Yoshikawa!
I'm coming for you right now!

00:12:34.554 --> 00:12:36.914
Oh, wait for me!

00:12:42.624 --> 00:12:44.054
Hey, that's the witch from Snow White!

00:12:49.434 --> 00:12:50.494
Ayumi!

00:12:51.504 --> 00:12:53.194
Mamiya! Yoshikawa's sister!

00:12:58.904 --> 00:13:00.934
The dragon from Sleeping Beauty?!

00:13:02.344 --> 00:13:04.204
I'm all tied up!

00:13:06.984 --> 00:13:11.044
Owww... If you're gonna let me down,
do it more gently!

00:13:14.424 --> 00:13:18.164
The Queen of Hearts from Alice in Wonderland?!

00:13:18.164 --> 00:13:22.224
No. Call me MISS Queen of Hearts!

00:13:28.874 --> 00:13:31.934
Oh, I know you! You're the wolf from
The Three Little Pigs!

00:13:33.174 --> 00:13:34.844
You are correct! And...

00:13:34.844 --> 00:13:36.034
Ta-da!

00:13:36.114 --> 00:13:38.514
The wolf from The Seven Little Goats!

00:13:39.114 --> 00:13:40.814
You've got it! And this is...

00:13:41.754 --> 00:13:44.044
The wolf from Little Red Riding Hood!

00:13:44.254 --> 00:13:45.754
That's right! And we are...

00:13:45.754 --> 00:13:48.694
The Wolf Brothers!

00:13:49.754 --> 00:13:50.594
What's that?

00:13:50.594 --> 00:13:51.824
A magic mirror?

00:13:51.824 --> 00:13:53.064
Are they witches?

00:13:53.064 --> 00:13:54.684
How can we be seeing stuff like that?

00:13:55.494 --> 00:14:01.174
Miss Yuri disappeared into the mirror and now
the mirror looks like a movie screen and...

00:14:01.174 --> 00:14:03.634
What's really going on?!

00:14:05.644 --> 00:14:08.344
This is bad. We have to do something about this.

00:14:08.344 --> 00:14:09.504
Right.

00:14:13.484 --> 00:14:16.114
Ah, ah, ahem! Allow me to explain!

00:14:16.114 --> 00:14:18.954
This play brought to you by the student council

00:14:18.954 --> 00:14:24.494
is a revolutionary and futuristic performance,
which combines 2D and 3D!

00:14:24.494 --> 00:14:26.684
We hope you all enjoy it!

00:14:26.864 --> 00:14:27.794
Huh?

00:14:27.794 --> 00:14:32.064
Oh, so that's what it was!
That's my Miss Yuri!

00:14:32.064 --> 00:14:34.374
Good job, Fuyuno! That was pretty good!

00:14:34.374 --> 00:14:37.734
Now all we need is for Big Sis and the others
to safely rescue Big Bro from out of there!

00:14:38.044 --> 00:14:39.604
Y-Yeah.

00:14:39.604 --> 00:14:42.374
And Miss Hongo, too...

00:14:42.374 --> 00:14:45.544
Huh? Don't tell me Miss Hongo is...

00:14:57.594 --> 00:15:00.854
You may be an old lady on the outside, but as long
as you're an evil witch, I will exterminate you!

00:15:04.634 --> 00:15:05.904
C-Come on, bring it on!

00:15:05.904 --> 00:15:08.194
I'm not gonna hold back so you'd better be ready!

00:15:08.404 --> 00:15:10.394
Gusty Wind Attack!

00:15:12.474 --> 00:15:15.564
Here comes the white powder! You're about
to turn into a sweet rice dumpling!

00:15:16.444 --> 00:15:17.604
No!

00:15:18.714 --> 00:15:21.844
And I'm going to eat you!

00:15:28.824 --> 00:15:31.724
Now, call me Miss Queen of Hearts!

00:15:31.724 --> 00:15:33.524
Hmph, you wish!

00:15:33.524 --> 00:15:36.964
How insolent! I will punish you
in the name of hearts!

00:15:38.604 --> 00:15:41.034
How dare you! Take this!

00:15:44.244 --> 00:15:45.474
Not bad!

00:15:45.474 --> 00:15:47.534
If that's how it's going to be,
what do you think about THIS?

00:15:52.544 --> 00:15:54.454
You evil witch who harms this world!

00:15:54.454 --> 00:15:58.544
I, the witch hunter Marin Nijihara,
shall exterminate you!

00:16:05.664 --> 00:16:08.864
It worked because of my wind attack!
Let me eat half!

00:16:08.864 --> 00:16:11.634
What are you talking about?
It was MY powder attack that did it!

00:16:11.634 --> 00:16:12.934
I'm the one who should get half!

00:16:12.934 --> 00:16:14.934
But I'm the one who knocked her out!

00:16:14.934 --> 00:16:16.934
I'm entitled to take half!

00:16:16.934 --> 00:16:17.664
Don't be ridiculous!

00:16:18.744 --> 00:16:20.674
Do not fight with your siblings!

00:16:24.214 --> 00:16:25.744
Th-This is...

00:16:25.744 --> 00:16:29.114
Look what you've done to a
delicate maiden's skin!

00:16:29.114 --> 00:16:29.884
I'm gonna make you pay!

00:16:34.294 --> 00:16:36.124
Wings of the black phoenix!

00:16:36.124 --> 00:16:38.114
Turn into thunder and destroy the darkness!

00:16:38.224 --> 00:16:40.024
Black Phoenix School Secret Technique!

00:16:40.024 --> 00:16:42.934
Black Phoenix Rumbling Crush!

00:16:47.734 --> 00:16:51.174
Come on, call me Miss Queen of Hearts!

00:16:51.774 --> 00:16:52.674
Huh?

00:16:54.774 --> 00:16:55.674
What? She can transform?!

00:16:55.914 --> 00:16:57.644
You'd better surrender, Queen!

00:17:01.414 --> 00:17:05.644
Take this! Take this! Now call ME Miss Queen!

00:17:05.884 --> 00:17:06.254
You like it when I do it like this here?

00:17:06.254 --> 00:17:09.124
Please spare me, Miss Queen!
You like it when I do it like this here?

00:17:12.024 --> 00:17:13.964
You've got to be kidding me!

00:17:19.634 --> 00:17:21.724
So Haruo is in there.

00:17:22.634 --> 00:17:24.204
Wait for me, Big Brother!

00:17:24.204 --> 00:17:28.114
Senior Yoshikawa, I'll rescue you
from the evil witch soon!

00:17:28.114 --> 00:17:28.974
Let's go!

00:17:28.974 --> 00:17:29.964
You don't have to tell me that!

00:17:37.984 --> 00:17:38.954
Haruo!

00:17:46.124 --> 00:17:46.824
Haruo!

00:17:46.824 --> 00:17:47.764
Big Brother!

00:17:47.764 --> 00:17:48.564
Yoshikawa!

00:17:48.564 --> 00:17:49.294
Senior!

00:17:52.704 --> 00:17:53.754
What the...

00:17:54.164 --> 00:17:56.104
Is this the beanstalk from Jack and the Beanstalk?!

00:17:57.944 --> 00:18:00.104
So you've come this far despite
the fact that you're cursed.

00:18:00.104 --> 00:18:01.714
I'm impressed with you, Big Sister.

00:18:01.714 --> 00:18:04.314
Or rather, was it all thanks to your friends?

00:18:04.314 --> 00:18:06.244
I told you, we are...

00:18:06.244 --> 00:18:08.274
...NOT friends!

00:18:08.584 --> 00:18:13.424
No matter. You'll eventually die in this place.

00:18:13.424 --> 00:18:14.894
What do you mean by that?

00:18:14.894 --> 00:18:19.394
Those beanstalks are an improved model,
designed to absorb all your magical power!

00:18:19.394 --> 00:18:20.524
What did you say?

00:18:27.004 --> 00:18:28.734
Why are you doing this to us?

00:18:28.734 --> 00:18:32.744
Isn't it obvious? I don't want to see
the curse lifted from you!

00:18:32.744 --> 00:18:34.364
What are you two talking about?

00:18:37.544 --> 00:18:39.944
As long as you're cursed, Ayumi,

00:18:39.944 --> 00:18:42.484
you'll never be able to become the
head of the Mamiya family!

00:18:42.484 --> 00:18:48.554
Being the head of the Mamiya family means
that you have the power to rule the magic world!

00:18:48.554 --> 00:18:51.084
And you got my brother involved
for something like that?!

00:18:53.924 --> 00:18:55.824
So, to get to me, you made Haruo...

00:18:58.134 --> 00:18:59.704
...sleep forever?!

00:18:59.704 --> 00:19:01.534
What else could I do?

00:19:01.534 --> 00:19:05.904
He's the only one that can lift
the curse from you, isn't he?

00:19:05.904 --> 00:19:08.944
It would've been much easier if it was just you,

00:19:08.944 --> 00:19:13.774
but now Rika is also in the human world,
so there's no telling what might happen.

00:19:14.314 --> 00:19:17.804
That's just... Big Brother...

00:19:21.354 --> 00:19:24.754
Release him NOW! If you do, I'll overlook this!

00:19:25.094 --> 00:19:28.624
Hmph! I wonder how much longer
you can speak to me in that manner!

00:19:29.064 --> 00:19:29.924
What?!

00:19:32.034 --> 00:19:33.794
Yoshikawa...

00:19:37.004 --> 00:19:39.944
Michiru... I hope you'll remember
what you've done to me!

00:19:39.944 --> 00:19:45.974
Oh, yeah? I don't think I'll ever
forget your pained expression.

00:19:51.884 --> 00:19:54.484
Haruo...

00:19:56.754 --> 00:19:58.984
This is the end, Big Sister!

00:20:02.364 --> 00:20:03.834
Haruo!

00:20:07.164 --> 00:20:10.934
Hmph! She sure was a pain until
the very last moment.

00:20:12.404 --> 00:20:18.074
Now that Big Sister is gone,
it'd be a waste to just keep him asleep.

00:20:18.344 --> 00:20:21.114
Maybe I should enslave him!

00:20:21.984 --> 00:20:23.744
Well, I guess it's about time...

00:20:25.224 --> 00:20:26.344
That's...

00:20:28.324 --> 00:20:30.084
Wh-What's that?

00:20:31.694 --> 00:20:33.764
How could you do this to Maika...

00:20:33.764 --> 00:20:36.194
How could you do this to Nijihara...

00:20:36.194 --> 00:20:39.464
and Kurosu... and Rika...

00:20:39.464 --> 00:20:42.594
How could you... How could you...

00:20:43.474 --> 00:20:45.944
How could you do this to Mamiya?!

00:20:51.744 --> 00:20:53.774
I'd better get out of here!

00:21:20.274 --> 00:21:21.464
Huh?

00:21:22.114 --> 00:21:24.244
What happened to us?

00:21:24.244 --> 00:21:25.414
Huh?

00:21:25.414 --> 00:21:26.684
What's going on?

00:21:26.684 --> 00:21:29.214
What's the matter? The bell is about to ring soon.

00:21:29.214 --> 00:21:30.844
Y-Yes!

00:21:34.384 --> 00:21:35.394
Huh?

00:21:35.394 --> 00:21:36.754
What's wrong?

00:21:37.094 --> 00:21:38.694
N-Nothing.

00:21:38.694 --> 00:21:43.294
I could've sworn that I was about to mention
something very important about Miss Hongo...

00:21:43.294 --> 00:21:45.094
But... what was it?

00:21:46.834 --> 00:21:49.074
What a fateful meeting!

00:21:49.074 --> 00:21:49.434
The very moment Cinderella and the prince met...

00:21:49.434 --> 00:21:50.804
It's different...
The very moment Cinderella and the prince met...

00:21:50.804 --> 00:21:54.294
Something's different from before, but why?
The very moment Cinderella and the prince met...

00:21:58.584 --> 00:22:00.614
How despicable!

00:22:00.614 --> 00:22:05.784
I swear I'll make you pay for this, Big Sister!

00:22:10.394 --> 00:22:13.364
MAGIKANO

00:22:19.864 --> 00:22:26.274
This is a secret, but I am a little different

00:22:26.274 --> 00:22:32.484
Do I look ordinary or cute? Yeah! Yeah!

00:22:32.484 --> 00:22:35.954
I know I'm mellow and mediocre

00:22:35.954 --> 00:22:39.024
But so what? So what?

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:42.124
But just as I was thinking that

00:22:42.124 --> 00:22:45.494
I got myself mixed up in trouble

00:22:45.494 --> 00:22:48.494
I'm not going to lose, I'm not going to give you up

00:22:48.494 --> 00:22:51.804
Because you are precious to me

00:22:51.804 --> 00:22:58.334
Maybe I should not cast a spell

00:22:59.774 --> 00:23:03.044
I don't want magic to be

00:23:03.044 --> 00:23:06.184
The reason why it's this way

00:23:06.184 --> 00:23:12.724
When it comes to love, it has to be real

00:23:12.724 --> 00:23:19.124
Who are you in love with?

00:23:19.124 --> 00:23:25.304
Everyone is dying to know the answer!

00:23:25.304 --> 00:23:28.604
Seriously, I have to guard you
from the love scramble that is about to begin

00:23:28.604 --> 00:23:30.074
It's a pinch! Here comes my punch!

00:23:37.614 --> 00:23:43.414
Ayumi gets concerned about Haruo, who doesn't
react at all to his own sisters' sexual charms.

00:23:44.314 --> 00:23:48.124
She becomes anxious and breaks out
her cat panties!

00:23:48.124 --> 00:23:51.794
She puts them on, but now she's cursed,
and there's only one way to take them off!

00:23:51.794 --> 00:23:54.264
Now things are way too exciting
for Haruo to handle!

00:23:54.264 --> 00:23:57.924
But the magic is too powerful
and chaos erupts at the school.

00:23:59.164 --> 00:24:02.674
Next time on Magikano:
"Magi? The Cat Panties are Cursed?"

00:24:02.674 --> 00:24:04.604
Look forward to it!
